        {
          "insert": "<!-- ~/.archon/commands/review-checklist.md -->\nReview the uncommitted changes in the current worktree.\nCheck for:\n- Error handling gaps\n- Missing tests\n- Surprising API shapes\n- Unnecessary cleverness\nBe terse. Report findings grouped by file."
